OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'misjudged it' when driving
OL,4,Ainto crowd - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who drove a car into a crowd of
OL,7,Fpeople said he "just misjudged it" when
OL,8,Ftrying to scare them.
OL,10,FDuane Anthony told a trial at
OL,11,FNottingham Crown Court on Tuesday he
OL,12,Fwas behind the wheel of a vehicle that
OL,13,Fhit five people on Gedling Road in
OL,14,FArnold on 9 May.
OL,16,FTyler Fairman, 26, later died from
OL,17,Finjuries he sustained in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
