OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'misjudged it' when driving
OL,4,Ainto crowd - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors have heard Anthony, 40, of
OL,7,FMarton Road in Bulwell, pleaded guilty
OL,8,Fto the manslaughter of Fairman but
OL,9,Fdenies murdering him. He has also
OL,10,Fpleaded not guilty to five counts of
OL,11,Fattempted murder but admits assault
OL,12,Foccasioning actual bodily harm to four
OL,13,Fmen.
